{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Here's a new game from the creator of Don't Be Afraid and Mandela Invasion!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/a3f1106167d3312e71675dfc3a43942a.avif?t=1767718966\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALYSSA</strong> is an adventure horror game, in which you play as a little girl who wakes up in an unfamiliar place\u2026 Or rather, she\u2019s awakened by <strong>Emily</strong>, who has a\u2026 strange mask permanently attached to her head. Armed with nothing but a small lighter, Alyssa must attempt to escape from this cursed place. Meanwhile, her tormentors lurk in the shadows, waiting for a single wrong move\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alyssa\u2019s</strong> only allies in this terrifying place will be her <strong>small lighter</strong>, the items she finds along the way, and the mysterious <strong>Emily</strong>, who appears here and there. You\u2019ll need to use your wits in many situations \u2014 <strong>no one intends to make your escape easy\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong> is the only way out \u2014 it\u2019s your <strong>greatest advantage!</strong> The ability to <strong>crawl under tables</strong> and <strong>hide in tight spaces</strong> will allow you to avoid lurking threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration plays a key role \u2014 not only to progress further, but also to uncover the many secrets hidden within. Darkness conceals numerous passages and items\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/57f667c27065de97643fc343e4145595.webp?t=1767718966\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive <strong>visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>shocking</strong> storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed</strong> and <strong>atmospheric</strong> locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>terrifying</strong> atmosphere with <strong>real darkness</strong>, where you can\u2019t see a thing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on <strong>stealth</strong> and avoiding danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark <strong>secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420580?t=1767718966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/d785ad9f62f1afa19aa765197229d8cccebcf6ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767718966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/4377b68dd2ba774dbd3f2fe1b4dac02b9c976c07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767718966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/4377b68dd2ba774dbd3f2fe1b4dac02b9c976c07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767718966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content inappropriate for all ages or not suitable for viewing at work: Frequent violence or brutality, Adult content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Here's a new game from the creator of Don't Be Afraid and Mandela Invasion!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://